WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Crouching lights begin the corner knockdown route.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.950
Heavy Shoryuken launches the opponent in the corner.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.450
Standing medium kick misses as the opponent is down.

4
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:03.950
Standing medium punch meets Ken as he rises and is blocked.

5
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.200
Both characters recover at close range after the blocked meaty.
